<Layout {...meta} mainClass="flex-1">
<nav aria-label="Migas de pan" class="border-b border-border/70 bg-secondary/40"><ol class="mx-auto flex max-w-[72rem] flex-wrap items-center gap-1 px-6 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/">Inicio</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 shrink-0 opacity-60"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a class="transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/it">IT</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 shrink-0 opacity-60"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground/80">Microsoft 365: gestión y seguridad</span></li></ol></nav><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[hsl(var(--ink))] text-white"><div aria-hidden="true" class="grid-lines absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07]"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[72rem] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-foreground/70">Servicios IT</p><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-[44rem] font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.9rem]">Microsoft 365: gestión y seguridad</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-[44rem] text-base leading-relaxed text-white/70 sm:text-lg">Microsoft 365 bien configurado mejora la productividad; mal configurado abre la puerta a la mayoría de incidentes de correo e identidad.</p><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center gap-2 bg-white px-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[hsl(var(--ink))] transition-transform hover:bg-white/90 active:scale-[0.98]" href="/diagnosticos">Solicitar diagnóstico<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center gap-2 border border-white/30 px-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white transition-colors hover:border-white/70" href="/empresa/contacto">Hablar con especialista</a></div></div></section><div class="mx-auto max-w-[72rem] space-y-16 px-6 py-16 sm:space-y-20 sm:py-20"><div class="" data-reveal><section><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,22rem)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-12"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))] sm:text-3xl">¿Qué es?</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><p>Nos encargamos del entorno Microsoft 365 completo: identidades, correo, colaboración, dispositivos y las políticas de seguridad que lo protegen.</p></div></div></section></div><div class="" data-reveal><section><div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))] sm:text-3xl">Qué incluye</h2><div class="mt-8 grid gap-px overflow-hidden border border-border bg-border sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40"><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Implantación y migración</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Correo, ficheros y colaboración con plan de migración por fases.</p></div><div class="bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40"><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Identidades y MFA</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Doble factor, acceso condicional y revisión de privilegios.</p></div><div class="bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40"><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Colaboración</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Teams, SharePoint y OneDrive con estructura y permisos definidos.</p></div><div class="bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40"><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Protección de correo</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Antiphishing, reglas, SPF, DKIM y DMARC.</p></div><div class="bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40"><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Dispositivos</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Políticas de cumplimiento y cifrado en equipos gestionados.</p></div><div class="bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40"><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Licenciamiento</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Revisión de licencias y ajuste al uso real.</p></div></div></div></section></div><div class="" data-reveal><section><div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))] sm:text-3xl">Preguntas frecuentes</h2><dl class="mt-8"><div class="border-t border-border py-5"><dt class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">¿Podéis revisar un tenant existente?</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Sí. Hacemos una revisión de configuración y seguridad y entregamos un informe con hallazgos priorizados.</dd></div><div class="border-t border-border py-5"><dt class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">¿Cuánto dura una migración?</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Para una empresa de 30-80 usuarios, entre 3 y 6 semanas incluyendo pruebas y acompañamiento posterior.</dd></div></dl></div></section></div></div><section class="border-y border-border bg-secondary/60"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[72rem] gap-8 px-6 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:items-center"><div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))] text-balance sm:text-[1.75rem]">¿Quieres saber cómo está realmente tu empresa?</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-[42rem] text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Solicita un diagnóstico inicial. Revisamos tu situación, te explicamos los riesgos que vemos y te proponemos un plan priorizado.</p><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><a href="tel:+34621157500" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-primary" data-analytics="phone-click"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone h-4 w-4"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg> 621 15 75 00</a><a href="mailto:info@coolnetworks.it" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors hover:text-primary" data-analytics="email-click"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg> info@coolnetworks.it</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row lg:flex-col"><a data-analytics="diagnostic-request" class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary px-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:bg-primary/90 active:scale-[0.98]" href="/diagnosticos">Solicitar diagnóstico<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a data-analytics="meeting-request" class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center border border-border bg-card px-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[hsl(var(--ink))] transition-colors hover:border-primary hover:text-primary" href="/empresa/contacto">Hablar con especialista</a></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[72rem] px-6 py-12"><h2 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">Contenido relacionado</h2><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border px-4 py-2 text-sm text-foreground/80 transition-colors hover:border-primary hover:text-primary" href="/ciberseguridad">Microsoft 365 Security<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border px-4 py-2 text-sm text-foreground/80 transition-colors hover:border-primary hover:text-primary" href="/it">Servicios IT<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></section>
